I bought this game thinking: "I like RTS and micromanagement games, this one has a non-combat focus, let's try it". All that I can say is: what a waste.
-Way to bugged (specially the micromanagment part);
-Limited options (you don't have much things like buildings, production, etc. to choose from);
-It really has a different approach to the genre;
4/10

